					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-403211#post-4379065</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-403211/cygnus#post-4379065</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 27 Sep 2019 21:41:19 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>wertsir</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1350942</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Step 1) Law enforcement and intelligence agencies begin investigating deaths.<br /> Step 2) Link to image is discovered, cases are merged.<br /> Step 3) Due to ongoing threat, dedicated task-force is created to seek out and destroy copies of image.<br /> Step 4) Containment difficulties warrant increasing size of task-force.<br /> Step 5) Discovery of altered images that produce different effects.<br /> Step 6) Ongoing expenses and discovery of related phenomenon result in the founding of dedicated agency.<br /> Step 7) Scale of threat results in merger of independent national agencies into international organization.<br /> Step 8) Organization drafts mission statement: Secure, Contain, Protect.<br /> Step 9) Organization renames itself the SCP foundation.<br /> Step 10) Foundation identifies and contains thousands of anomalies.<br /> Step 11) Foundation discovers copies of classified documents on internet site.<br /> Step 12) Reality-restructuring behavior observed in documents, reclassified as SCP-001<br /> Step 13) 05 Council votes to upload copy of original image to SCP-001</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
