					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-403211#post-2356050</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-403211/cygnus#post-2356050</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2015 01:17:37 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Drawing Glasses</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2218992</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Think about what would happen if this actually worked. Suddenly, a sizable group of people dies. Soon, it is realized that the last website they looked at kills anyone who looks at it. The website is shut down, and studied by scientists. Either:<br /> 1. Everyone becomes aware of memetic hazard images.<br /> 2. These images are used in secret by the government.</p> <p>Once people learn how they work, they could adapt them for other functions other than killing, such as imbedding thoughts, or who knows what.</p> <p>My headcannon is an omniverse, or a multiverse of multiverses, so this could have already happened, somewhere.</p> <p>(Also, fixed a small typo, missing the word &quot;the.&quot;)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
